  "title": "Saudi Arabia: TotalEnergies and Aljomaih Energy & Water Awarded a 400 MW Solar Project",
  "summary": "Paris, October 28, 2025 – The consortium comprising France’s TotalEnergies and Saudi developer Aljomaih Energy & Water (AEW) has been awarded by the Saudi Power Procurement Company (SPPC) following a tender process, the license to develop, build and operate a 400 megawatts (MW) solar power plant in As Sufun, KSA. The electricity produced will be sold […]",
